Subject: Add secret-of-monkey-island-floppy-es-data, the Spanish VGA floppy
 release

The Spanish floppy release of The Secret of Monkey Island (VGA, eight
disks: 000.lfl, 901-904.lfl and disk01-08.lec) was not known to gdp, so a
Spanish owner got no package from it. ScummVM knows it
(engines/scumm/scumm-md5.h: 000.LFL 93f436541c10ce1e8a72cb3878ec0347,
monkey VGA ES_ESP DOS). The 901-904.lfl it ships are byte for byte the
German floppy's; the sizes and checksums of the other files are from an
owner's copy.

Forwarded: not yet (candidate for Debian)

diff --git a/data/monkey.yaml b/data/monkey.yaml
--- a/data/monkey.yaml
+++ b/data/monkey.yaml
@@ -44,6 +44,12 @@ packages:
     install:
     - assets floppy german
 
+  secret-of-monkey-island-floppy-es-data:
